notes.content:
1. Added a talent system where players can choose their talents before starting the game. Different talents have different attributes, and the maximum limit for carrying soul stones and magic circles also varies. Some talents have special effects or exclusive special rewards. For the new contract holder, please refer to the game for details. More talents will be released in the future or official version, please stay tuned;
2. Add a simple mode that can be selected by oneself in the talent system;
3. Increase the reward for 'Soul Resonance';
4. Detail optimization.

1. Fixed the bug in the game where pressing ESC would increase the amount of coins;
2. Add two types of monsters: Split Slime and Bomb Goblin;
3. In the annihilation wave, there is a probability that a curse effect will occur, giving the character a debuff that lasts for one round;
4. Add 7 cards: "Unstoppable Changes", "Adrenaline", "Perfectionism", etc;
5. Adjust some reward effects;
6. Other optimizations
